    "**App Info** (shared across versions): **App Name**, **Subtitle**, **Privacy Policy URL**." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**App-Informationen** (für alle Versionen): **App-Name**, **Untertitel**, **URL der Datenschutzrichtlinie**."
