    "Connect your App Store Connect API key once and Screenshot Bro can upload exported screenshots to a specific app version without leaving the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verbinde einmalig deinen App Store Connect-API-Schlüssel, dann kann Screenshot Bro exportierte Screenshots in eine bestimmte App-Version hochladen, ohne dass du die App verlässt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conecta tu clave de API de App Store Connect una vez y Screenshot Bro podrá subir las capturas exportadas a una versión concreta de tu app sin salir de ella."
          }
        },
        "fa" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "یک بار کلید API در App Store Connect را وصل کنید تا Screenshot Bro بتواند بدون خروج از برنامه، اسکرین‌شات‌های صادرشده را در نسخهٔ مشخصی از برنامه آپلود کند."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connectez une fois votre clé API App Store Connect, et Screenshot Bro pourra envoyer les captures d'écran exportées vers une version précise de votre app sans quitter l'application."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Collega una volta la tua chiave API di App Store Connect e Screenshot Bro potrà caricare gli screenshot esportati in una versione specifica dell'app senza uscire dall'app."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store Connect の API キーを一度接続すれば、Screenshot Bro からアプリを離れずに、書き出したスクリーンショットを特定のアプリバージョンにアップロードできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store Connect API 키를 한 번 연결해 두면 Screenshot Bro가 앱을 벗어나지 않고 내보낸 스크린샷을 특정 앱 버전에 업로드할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conecte sua chave de API do App Store Connect uma vez e o Screenshot Bro poderá enviar as capturas de tela exportadas para uma versão específica do app sem sair do aplicativo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Подключите ключ App Store Connect API один раз, и Screenshot Bro сможет загружать экспортированные скриншоты в нужную версию приложения, не выходя из приложения."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store Connect API anahtarınızı bir kez bağlayın; Screenshot Bro dışa aktarılan ekran görüntülerini uygulamadan çıkmadan belirli bir uygulama sürümüne yükleyebilir."
