    "It's running. Results are in App Store Connect; choose New Experiment to test other screenshots." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es läuft. Die Ergebnisse findest du in App Store Connect; wähle „Neues Experiment“, um andere Screenshots zu testen."
